&lt;p&gt;The activity of two promoters (A and B) upstream of a luciferase reporter in response to transcription factor TF-X in a cell line was studied. Luciferase activity was measured in cells following overexpression and RNAi silencing of TF-X and compared to control (Native TF-X level). The luciferase enzyme activity is tabulated below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

