&lt;p&gt;A child injures his toe, which then becomes infected with &lt;em&gt;Staphylococcus aureus.&lt;/em&gt; The following statements are made about the events that follow over the course of a week:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;A. The pathogen is conveyed to draining lymph nodes by macrophages.&lt;/p&gt;

